# --- compilados do MetaEditor ---
*.ex5
*.ex4

# --- saidas do EA ---
# Logger grava em Common\Files (fora deste repo). Estes padroes
# pegam copia local, dump de analise e pasta Files/ do MQL5.
*.csv
*.log
*.htm
*.html
Files/
Logs/
Tester/
Reports/

# --- dados de mercado ---
*.hst
*.hcc
*.fxt
*.tkc

# --- presets do Testador ---
# .set guarda todos os input. Neste EA nao ha senha, mas ha
# InpLiveOrders / InpLots / InpMagic. Nao versionar.
# Preset de estudo versionavel: salve como *.set.example
*.set
!*.set.example
*.ini
*.chr
*.tpl

# --- segredos ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- sistema operacional ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- backups ---
*.bak
*.old
*.orig
_old/

# --- editores ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
